{%- comment -%}
  Paste this into the "Quadrant" tab of the weather-yr plugin's Edit Markup
  screen (separate from the "Full" tab's template.liquid). Compact version
  for small Mashup panes - just current temp + condition + today's range.

  Font-family is set inline to force smooth Inter instead of the default
  pixel font, scoped to just this plugin (see template.liquid for why).

  Sizing note: a Quadrant pane is only ~1/4 of the screen, so it needs much
  smaller Value sizes than the Full view (value--xlarge is 74px and will
  overflow/clip badly here).

  Icon row: weather icon (left) - temperature (center) - clothing proposal
  icon (right), all set to the same explicit 36px height via inline style
  so they match the temperature text's size exactly (see template.liquid's
  Full view for the same idea at a bigger size). The extra rain-gear icon
  (shown in Full view when current.needs_rain_gear is true) is skipped
  here - there's only room for one icon on the right in this small a pane.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="layout layout--col layout--center gap--xsmall" style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
  <div class="layout layout--row layout--center-y gap--xsmall">
    <img class="image" src="{{ current.icon_url }}" width="36" height="36" style="width: 36px; height: 36px;">
    <div class="value" style="font-size: 36px; line-height: 1;">{{ current.temperature }}°</div>
    <img class="image" src="{{ current.clothing_icon_url }}" width="36" height="36" style="width: 36px; height: 36px;">
  </div>
  <div class="label">{{ current.condition_text }}</div>
  <div class="description">H {{ today.high }}° / L {{ today.low }}°</div>
</div>

<div class="title_bar" style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
  <span class="title">Alsjön</span>
  <span class="instance">{{ updated_display }}</span>
</div>
